<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueGetStatus</function></refname>
  <refpurpose></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">enum SilikoValueStatus SilikoValueGetStatus(
    const SilikoValue *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueGetStatus</function> function gets the
status of <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoValueGetStatus</function> returns the status
  of <varname>object</varname> indicating which kind of value
  <varname>object</varname> holds. If <varname>object</varname> is
  <literal>NULL</literal>, <function>SilikoValueGetStatus</function>
  returns <literal>SilikoValueError</literal>.</para>
</refsection>
